{"id": "S009", "owasp": "A04:2021 - Insecure Design", "cwe": "CWE-307", "language": "python", "description": "No rate limit or lockout on login", "vulnerable_code": "def login(u, p):\n    return check(u, p)", "fixed_code": "def login(u, p):\n    if attempts.get(u, 0) >= 5:\n        raise Locked(u)\n    ok = check(u, p)\n    attempts[u] = 0 if ok else attempts.get(u, 0) + 1\n    return ok", "source": "original, written for this project", "license": "MIT"}
